	quest.27CCD13EE88E6540.title: "Stoned Outta My Mind"
	quest.27D1256010835160.quest_desc: [
		"Silicon Wash can be used in the Centrifuge to create &7Silicon Wafers&r, or be used in the Refiner to create &eSilicon from Sand.&r"
		""
		"Oh, and by the way. &4This is NOT the aforementioned \"next quest.\"&r If you're not seeing it, then perhaps you should pursue some other sections of the quest tree?"
	]
	quest.27D1256010835160.quest_subtitle: "This Is...a Shark Tale Exclusive"
	quest.27D1256010835160.title: "Workin' At the Silicon Wash"
	quest.28A0B8C6D3A0EA98.quest_desc: ["By shooting class 1M lasers &4directly into your eyeballs, &rthese goggles will replace your vision with state-of-the-art &9night vision&r technology."]
	quest.28A0B8C6D3A0EA98.quest_subtitle: "Now you see me, now you still see me"
	quest.28A0B8C6D3A0EA98.title: "Special Operation"
	quest.28C59DFF9ACEA3BD.quest_desc: [
		"The regular generator isn't the &ooonly &rway of generating electricity. There are also &9other generators&r to use, which can consume different fuels. This one consumes lava, so it might be useful for powering machines in the Nether. Unfortunately, there isn't really an efficient way to transfer items or fluids between dimensions, though you're always welcome to try..."
		""
		"(Oh, by the way. Did you know that &6pointed dripstone&r can drip &6lava&r into &7cauldrons&r? That would certainly be useful.)"
	]
	quest.28C59DFF9ACEA3BD.quest_subtitle: "I Lava You"
	quest.28C59DFF9ACEA3BD.title: "Magmatic Dynamo"
	quest.297BFD628CD19DC2.quest_desc: [
		"Welcome to the &aAutomation Challenges section!"
		""
		"In here, you'll find quests which require you to submit hundreds, thousands, and even &cMILLIONS &rof items to complete the quest. Of course, you won't be able to do this by hand (if you do then you are legally insane), so you'll have to use OriTech's wide variety of machines to do it for you."
	]
	quest.297BFD628CD19DC2.quest_subtitle: "Welcome to the Automation Nation."
