	quest.2C8FEB6C290935D2.quest_subtitle: "And nothing else. This is the Purple Stuff."
	quest.2C8FEB6C290935D2.title: "Soda, OJ, Purple Stuff"
	quest.2CBAF82CAAF33949.quest_desc: ["The Atomic Forge is capable of using its advanced lasers (the ones YOU placed) to slice and dice a &4seemingly impure lump of silicon&r into a silicon wafer. Did you know that in &cGregtech&r (and in Real Life), they grow pure silicon as a \"boule\" which is chopped up into wafers?"]
	quest.2CBAF82CAAF33949.quest_subtitle: "These wafers aren't for eating!!!"
	quest.2CBAF82CAAF33949.title: "Necco"
	quest.2CC740E24B161ED1.quest_subtitle: "Like, oh my GOSH!!!"
	quest.2CC740E24B161ED1.title: "A Girl's Best Friend"
	quest.2D4C4760FD907213.quest_desc: ["Process your new &csolid biofuel &ror &epacked wheat&r in your upgraded Centrifuge to form this slimy sheet of &2biopolymer.&r This is integral to making both &5plastic and Biosteel."]
	quest.2D4C4760FD907213.quest_subtitle: "Polymers take the shape they do, combining base-level residues"
	quest.2D4C4760FD907213.title: "Polymerization"
	quest.2D9AEE555AE9DE9F.quest_subtitle: "<laugh track>"
	quest.2D9AEE555AE9DE9F.title: "Wheat's the Big Deal?"
	quest.2DE49D9166764D8C.quest_subtitle: "Under Pressure"
	quest.2DE49D9166764D8C.title: "In The Rough"
	quest.2E72EC57963BD8DE.quest_subtitle: "Well, I don't know but I've been told, Uranium Ore's worth more than gold"
	quest.2E72EC57963BD8DE.title: "Uranium Fever"
	quest.2E7E5CA9A8EBDBD3.quest_desc: ["Want something a bit cooler than a regular pipe? Maybe you want to &bvisualize the flow of items through your network?&r For that, try this very stylish and very cool &7Clear Pipe!"]
	quest.2E7E5CA9A8EBDBD3.quest_subtitle: "*Transforms into pure glass*"
