	quest.302E14B6FB15153F.quest_desc: [
		"Once you've gotten your &5clumps, &ryou can put them into your &6centrifuge&r to extract gems from them. From there, you can do multiple things:"
		""
		"-&7Smelt them&r for a 1:1 gem to ingot ratio"
		"-&6Alloy two of them&r together for a 2:3 gem to ingot ratio"
		"-&dEngrave them&r for a 1:2 gem to dust (which turns into an ingot) ratio (note that you also need &52 fluxite&r for each engraving operation)"
		""
		"You can also use them to purchase &6mob drops&r from the shop, if you're playing on Peaceful (or are too lazy to go out and kill some mobs or make a mob farm.)"
	]
	quest.302E14B6FB15153F.quest_subtitle: "...wait. These aren't diamonds."
	quest.302E14B6FB15153F.title: "Diamond in the Rough"
	quest.30E7CF607DAB6D58.quest_subtitle: "I'm sowwy :("
	quest.30E7CF607DAB6D58.title: "A Severe Continuous Lapis in Judgement"
	quest.3121FCCD96A57927.quest_subtitle: "I expect you to grind, Mr. Bond"
	quest.3121FCCD96A57927.title: "007: License to Mill"
	quest.3203B78314C14366.quest_desc: [
		"It's time to refine!"
		""
		"The refiner has a liquid input, and an item input. Most refiner recipes require both a liquid and an item."
		""
		"Now, when you first construct the refiner, you'll only have &a&cone output tank active.&r This means that you'll only be able to get one of up to three different output liquids. This is where the Refinery Tank modules come in to play. &aYou can put up to TWO on top of the refiner (don't forget to actually BUILD them with cores!) to unlock additional tanks for refinery output.&r"
	]
	quest.3203B78314C14366.quest_subtitle: "Why yes I DO like caviar"
	quest.3203B78314C14366.title: "Refined Tastes"
	quest.32F7A36DB43EDD45.quest_subtitle: "get it"
	quest.32F7A36DB43EDD45.title: "^"
	quest.34DDD09BA4F1D05D.quest_desc: ["The Fragment Forge is a crucial step in getting &aMore from your Ores!&r If you put an ore block in there, it will &6double the output!&r If you put a &9raw ore&r in there, it won't necessarily double the output, but you will get some &aore clumps&r, as well as a few extra &dsmall clumps!&r These clumps can be centrifuged into &5Gems&r, which hold &oextra value&r in the shop!"]
	quest.34DDD09BA4F1D05D.quest_subtitle: "Have you noticed that you're playing on NEOForge instead of regular Forge???"
	quest.34DDD09BA4F1D05D.title: "Modloader Drama"
	quest.3564087B4CE19B31.quest_subtitle: "The missile knows where it is because it knows where it isn't"
	quest.3564087B4CE19B31.title: "Texas Instrumental"
	quest.3632FB64AC0951E2.quest_desc: ["Once you have &5Fluxite, &ryou can combine them with your Processing chips to create a new kind of chip!"]
	quest.3632FB64AC0951E2.quest_subtitle: "Shiny Inside(tm)"
	quest.3632FB64AC0951E2.title: "Crystal Computing"
	quest.36CED46D16E2E8C3.quest_desc: ["This &bMachine Addon &rwill become useful once you have a &ablock breaker, Enderic Laser, or Fragment Forge.&r It'll double the &6byproduct&r amounts in the Fragment Forge (that's the tiny dusts you'll get from processing raw ores), and it will also &5increase block drops&r for the Enderic Laser and Block Destroyer. &cNote that 3 is the effective maximum!"]
	quest.36CED46D16E2E8C3.quest_subtitle: "Back in 'Nam"
	quest.36CED46D16E2E8C3.title: "Fortunate Son"
	quest.380F4914438CE563.quest_desc: [
		"With the &6Foundry, &ryou now have the ability to create &eDuratium, &ra material used to make mid and late-game machines. However, in order to get it, you'll need &8Netherite&r and &bPlatinum."
		""
		"Netherite? Ugh...but that's SO hard to find!!! If only there was some way to make this WITHOUT Netherite...hmm...."
	]
	quest.380F4914438CE563.quest_subtitle: "...even though you can't actually make tools out of it..."
	quest.380F4914438CE563.title: "Stronger Than Netherite"
	quest.3863DDEB82D6184C.quest_desc: [
		"This is probably the first &bResearch Addon&r you'll be able to make. Simply build it onto the side of your Cybernetic Research station to unlock all the relevant upgrades."
		""
		"You'll be able to go so far with this one, but you'll need to craft the other two Addons to unlock the rest of the tech tree."
	]
	quest.3863DDEB82D6184C.quest_subtitle: "Welcome to Seizure Central"
	quest.3863DDEB82D6184C.title: "Jack the Ripperdoc"
	quest.38FF5CBCA8E4CC38.quest_desc: [
		"Did you find a great place to set up a base, but there's just &2so much grass in the way?&r This potent anti-planty formula will vaporize any grass and plants within a certain distance!"
		""
		"&4WARNING: &rDo not ingest. Do not allow skin contact. Do not mix with water. Do not allow prolonged exposure with oxygen. Do not insult or its feelings will get hurt."
	]
	quest.38FF5CBCA8E4CC38.quest_subtitle: "If you or a loved one has been exposed to Roundup Weed Killer, you may be entitled to financial compensation"
